&lt;p&gt;Ocado Technology builds the systems behind some of the world’s most advanced grocery fulfilment: the Hive grid, thousands of bots, robotic picking and automated frame loading, all run by software our Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams write every day. More and more of that software is now built with AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That makes finance here far from routine. Cloud and AI are among our fastest-moving costs, and how we capitalise engineering time directly shapes our P&amp;amp;L. Decisions made by engineering leaders this quarter show up in our cash flow next quarter. We want someone who’ll help make those decisions, not just report on them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you our person?&lt;/strong&gt; You’re curious about how things work, commercially sharp, and happy to challenge the way things are done when you can see a better way. You can juggle competing priorities and build trust at every level, from engineers to VPs. And you’re comfortable with AI: Claude is an official member of the team here, and you’ll work alongside it every day.&lt;/p&gt;
